        "official_en_sha256": "b205d082419b4d99c2214e389bfc4b8df10194a154869729aabe89f4f232cd41"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "あとは幽鬼兵化計画に必要な物資輸送を\r\n妨害し続ければいい。\r\n全てはソゼを救うためだ。",
        "official_en": "<text style=\"italic\">“All that remains now is for me to continue my sabotage on the supply shipments</>\r\n<text style=\"italic\">that feed his twisted plan. All that I do, I do for Emperor Sozhe.</>",
        "real_en": "<text style=\"italic\">“Now I just need to keep disrupting the supply shipments needed for the ghost-soldier plan. Everything is to save Sozhe.</>"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
