      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "しかし、それだけでは時間稼ぎにしかならない。",
        "official_en": "<text style=\"italic\">“Yet, I fear these efforts alone will serve nothing more than to delay the inevitable.</>",
        "real_en": "<text style=\"italic\">“But that will only buy us time.</>"
