      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そこでラザロフの目が届かない場所に\r\n左遷されるように仕向けた。",
        "official_en": "<text style=\"italic\">“As such, I contrived a plan to be demoted to a position of insignificance,</>\r\n<text style=\"italic\">somewhere beyond the reach of Lazarov’s hawkish eyes.</>",
        "real_en": "<text style=\"italic\">“So I arranged to be demoted somewhere beyond Lazarov’s reach.</>"
