      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ソゼ皇帝は死ぬ直前にシエラと話すことができたんだ。\r\nたぶん洗脳が完璧じゃなかったんだと思う。",
        "official_en": "Right before he died, Emperor Sozhe was able to talk to Shera. I think that was because his brainwashing was flawed...",
        "real_en": "Just before he died, Emperor Sozhe was able to talk to Shera. I think his brainwashing might not have been complete."
      },
