        "official_en_sha256": "93ed590a6f32687a544ec774d1466a1a3af53e5f1c202d31158f542f4cdab4d0"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ラザロフの幽鬼兵化を妨害するためには、\r\n自由に行動できる立場になる必要がある。",
        "official_en": "<text style=\"italic\">“In order to stop Lazarov turning people into those ghastly wraiths, it was imperative that I got myself into a position where I could avoid any unnecessary attention.</>",
        "real_en": "<text style=\"italic\">“To interfere with Lazarov’s plan to turn people into ghost soldiers, I need to be in a position where I can act freely.</>"
      },
