      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ラザロフの所業に関しては部下たちに伝えた。\r\n証拠もこの場所に揃えてある。",
        "official_en": "<text style=\"italic\">“Therefore, I have dispatched my men, who carry word of Lazarov’s maniacal scheme. And with me here, I have also gathered the proof we need to bring him down.</>",
